+# Customs Storage Entry details presentation (FRO-354)
+
+FRO-354's Customs Storage Entry details page is prepared here as controlled
+React components on UI view models. It is **unconnected preparation**, not a
+working Customs Storage feature or completion of the ticket's acceptance
+criteria. There is no route, menu entry, service, GraphQL document, authority,
+persistence or backend change.
+
+## Components and state ownership
+
+- `components/customs-storage-details-layout.tsx` — page states (loading,
+  load error + Retry, not found, access denied), `TopBar` with
+  **Customs Storage Entry {number}**, subtitle **Order {Stock ID} · {entry
+  date-time}**, the `headerActions` place reserved for FRO-358's Print,
+  **Back to Order** only with return context, the covered-child banner, and the
+  outer `Card` with three `Tabs` (Overview, Related Supplier Invoices (N),
+  Related Export) and local arrow/Home/End roving focus.
+- `components/order-relationship-card.tsx` — the owning Order's read-only
+  facts with **Unknown** and **Missing** markers. **Edit** opens Change Order:
+  a `SearchPicker` in which the current Order and Orders covered by this entry
+  show their own reasons and other ineligible Orders show the FRO-319 reason
+  (with **Open** for an entry); a server rejection message; Cancel / Save.
+- `components/change-order-dialog.tsx` — **Change Order to {Stock ID}?** with
+  the warehouse warning when the chosen Order was admitted elsewhere, Cancel /
+  Confirm change.
+- `components/entry-details-card.tsx` — sub-cards **Entry details → Goods and
+  transport → Warehouse operator** read-only, with **Created by**; **Edit**
+  turns the ten entry-owned fields into controls (`DatePicker` +
+  `Input type="time"`, MRN date with Clear, tariff, goods, transport, permit,
+  operator, ΑΦΜ, address). Entry number and Transport Company stay read-only.
+  Shows the warehouse review notice after a Change Order to another warehouse.
+- `components/related-invoices-card.tsx`, `components/related-export-card.tsx`
+  — the owning Order's invoices (per-row currency, Statistical VAT, EUR-only
+  `tfoot` totals, mixed-currency alert) and the Export (facts, Customs status,
+  "n of m", empty explanations). Read-only.
+- `components/discard-changes-dialog.tsx` — **Discard your changes?** for
+  Back to Order with a changed draft.
+- `components/customs-storage-details-ui-parts.tsx` — card heading with an
+  action slot, `EditButton` (disabled with a hint while another card edits),
+  `EditActions` (validation / failed / stale + Refresh, Cancel / Save),
+  `cancelOnEscape`, read-only field, record link, value marker, amount and
+  Athens date-time formatting, `SearchPicker`, `focusEntryField` and
+  `entryErrorMessage`.
+- `customs-storage-details-rules.ts` — page-side rules: Statistical VAT and
+  EUR-only totals, Export coverage, validation of entry-owned values and first
+  error field, one editor at a time, dirty check, Change Order options,
+  entry date-time label and warehouse change. FRO-319 remains authoritative.
+- `localization/customs-storage-details-labels.ts` — EN/EL copy through
+  `useLocale`.
+
+The heading, field, link, marker, picker, money/validation rules, invoice and
+Export cards are local copies of FRO-353's parts
+(`mock/fro-353-customs-storage-entry-create`,
+`../create/`), so this folder shares no file with another mock branch.
+De-duplicate them with `create/` when both features are integrated.
+
+The eventual controller owns the page and edit state above the conditionally
+mounted tab panels, so an open draft survives tab and language changes and
+rejected saves. It must:
+
+- load the entry by id and map failures: denied → `denied`, missing →
+  `notFound`, other errors → `error` with Retry; never show a failed or denied
+  read as not found;
+- read the return context (FRO-355 Open from the owner or a covered child,
+  FRO-353 creation) and show the created toast **Customs Storage Entry
+  {number} created.** when arriving from creation;
+- keep `editing` to one card (`canStartEdit`, `editBlocked`); hide Edit without
+  edit authority;
+- **Entry details:** copy `entry.values` into the draft on Edit; on Save run
+  `validateEntryValues`, on errors show `validation` and call
+  `focusEntryField(firstErrorField(errors))`; send only the entry-owned values
+  with `entry.version`; map failure → `failed`, version conflict → `stale`
+  (Refresh reloads the entry and keeps the draft); on success replace the
+  entry, close the editor and toast **Changes saved.**;
+- **Change Order:** debounce FRO-319's Order search for entry creation, ignore
+  stale responses, clear the choice when the query is typed over, restore the
+  chosen Stock ID on close; Save opens `ChangeOrderDialog` with
+  `otherWarehouse` when `warehouseChanged`; Confirm sends the Order and
+  `entry.version`; map an ineligible answer → `rejected`, failure → `failed`,
+  conflict → `stale`; on success replace the entry (derived values, invoices,
+  Export), set `warehouseReview` when the warehouse changed, toast **Order
+  changed to {Stock ID}.** and keep the return context;
+- ask `DiscardChangesDialog` on Back to Order only when the open draft is
+  dirty (`isEditDirty`, or a chosen Order) and warn on unload while dirty.
+
+## Dependencies blocking integration
+
+Inspected baseline: production `main` at
+`5c51030680c9d45b3827a7e19b8320c19aa5ed9a`.
+
+| Capability                                                        | Missing source                           | Owner               |
+| ----------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------- | ------------------- |
+| Entry read with owner, derived facts, version and creator         | No Customs Storage Entry entity or reads | FRO-319             |
+| Edit entry-owned values with version precondition                 | No entry operations                      | FRO-319             |
+| Change Order and Order search for entry creation with eligibility | No entry operations or reads             | FRO-319             |
+| View / create-edit authorities                                    | Not in `../../auth/types.ts`             | FRO-319             |
+| Customs regime, warehouse licences, storage admission             | Unmerged `chriskazakos/fro-356-…` branch | FRO-356             |
+| Supplier Invoices of type Αποθήκη Αποθήκευσης                     | No Supplier Invoice entity               | FRO-321             |
+| Export holding the invoices and its Customs status                | No Export entity                         | FRO-317             |
+| Page route, FRO-355 Open and FRO-353 landing, Print, list entry   | Not built                                | FRO-354/355/353/358 |
+
+Available today: `PurchaseOrderStatusPill` and the existing Order search text
+(Stock ID, message number, references, vessel, colli tracking code), which the
+FRO-319 search read reuses.
+
+## Verification
+
+Run from `frontline-forwarding-client/` (Node 22.13.0 required):
+
+```sh
+npm run test -- src/features/customs-storage
+npm run test
+npm run build
+npx prettier --check src/features/customs-storage
+npx tsc --noEmit
+```
+
+Tests cover the page-side rules (written first), EN/EL label parity, the
+header and return context, covered-child banner, page states, tab keyboard
+navigation, one editor at a time, Change Order reasons, rejection and dialog,
+entry fields in read and edit mode with errors and feedback, invoice totals and
+currency handling, Export coverage and the discard dialog. They do not
+establish server validation, permission, concurrency or refresh correctness.
+
+Design authority: [DESIGN.md](../../../../DESIGN.md),
+[theme.css](../../../styles/theme.css) and the shared component source.
